om/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/706757583","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6009#issuecomment-706757583","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6009","id":706757583,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcwNjc1NzU4Mw==","user":{"login":"OlegLoginov","id":31254529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjU0NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31254529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-11T19:40:58Z","updated_at":"2020-10-11T19:40:58Z","body":"The renaming workaround for YSQL.\r\nIt works for columns with the same type.\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# create table t (a int, b int, c int, h int primary key);\r\nCREATE TABLE\r\nyugabyte=# insert into t (a,b,c,h) values (1,2,3,4);\r\nINSERT 0 1\r\nyugabyte=# insert into t (a,b,c,h) values (5,6,7,8);\r\nINSERT 0 1\r\nyugabyte=# select * from t;\r\n a | b | c | h \r\n---+---+---+---\r\n 1 | 2 | 3 | 4\r\n 5 | 6 | 7 | 8\r\n(2 rows)\r\nyugabyte=# alter table t drop a;\r\nALTER TABLE\r\nyugabyte=# select * from t;\r\n b | c | h \r\n---+---+---\r\n 2 | 3 | 4\r\n 6 | 7 | 8\r\n(2 rows)\r\n```\r\nCreate the DB backup. Restore it (into DB `yb2` in the example.)\r\n```\r\n$ ./bin/ysqlsh -d yb2\r\nyb2=# select * from t;\r\n b | c | h \r\n---+---+---\r\n 1 | 2 | 4\r\n 5 | 6 | 8\r\n(2 rows)\r\nyb2=# alter table t rename b to a;\r\nALTER TABLE\r\nyb2=# alter table t rename c to b;\r\nALTER TABLE\r\nyb2=# alter table t add c int;\r\nALTER TABLE\r\nyb2=# select * from t;\r\n a | b | h | c \r\n---+---+---+---\r\n 1 | 2 | 4 | 3\r\n 5 | 6 | 8 | 7\r\n(2 rows)\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/706757583/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"OlegLoginov","id":31254529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjU0NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31254529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/706757688","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6009#issuecomment-706757688","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6009","id":706757688,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcwNjc1NzY4OA==","user":{"login":"OlegLoginov","id":31254529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjU0NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31254529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-11T19:41:44Z","updated_at":"2020-10-11T19:41:44Z","body":"Workaround for different column types in YSQL table.\r\nSource table `yugabyte.t4`:\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# create table t4 (h int primary key, a int, b float, c text);\r\nCREATE TABLE\r\nyugabyte=# insert into t4 (h,a,b,c) values (1,2,3.14,'qqq');\r\nINSERT 0 1\r\nyugabyte=# insert into t4 (h,a,b,c) values (4,5,6.14,'www');\r\nINSERT 0 1\r\nyugabyte=# select * from t4;\r\n h | a |  b   |  c  \r\n---+---+------+-----\r\n 1 | 2 | 3.14 | qqq\r\n 4 | 5 | 6.14 | www\r\n(2 rows)\r\nyugabyte=# alter table t4 drop a;\r\nALTER TABLE\r\nyugabyte=# \\d t4\r\n                     Table \"public.t4\"\r\n Column |       Type       | Collation | Nullable | Default \r\n--------+------------------+-----------+----------+---------\r\n h      | integer          |           | not null | \r\n b      | double precision |           |          | \r\n c      | text             |           |          | \r\nIndexes:\r\n    \"t4_pkey\" PRIMARY KEY, lsm (h HASH)\r\n```\r\nCreate backup. Restore it into DB `yb7`. Recreate the table columns in correct original order with correct types & names:\r\n```\r\n$ ./bin/ysqlsh -d yb7\r\nyb7=# \\d t4\r\n                     Table \"public.t4\"\r\n Column |       Type       | Collation | Nullable | Default \r\n--------+------------------+-----------+----------+---------\r\n h      | integer          |           | not null | \r\n b      | double precision |           |          | \r\n c      | text             |           |          | \r\nIndexes:\r\n    \"t4_pkey\" PRIMARY KEY, lsm (h HASH)\r\nyb7=# alter table t4 drop b;\r\nALTER TABLE\r\nyb7=# alter table t4 drop c;\r\nALTER TABLE\r\nyb7=# alter table t4 add a int;\r\nALTER TABLE\r\nyb7=# alter table t4 add b float;\r\nALTER TABLE\r\nyb7=# alter table t4 add c text;\r\nALTER TABLE\r\nyb7=# \\d t4\r\n                     Table \"public.t4\"\r\n Column |       Type       | Collation | Nullable | Default \r\n--------+------------------+-----------+----------+---------\r\n h      | integer          |           | not null | \r\n a      | integer          |           |          | \r\n b      | double precision |           |          | \r\n c      | text             |           |          | \r\nIndexes:\r\n    \"t4_pkey\" PRIMARY KEY, lsm (h HASH)\r\n```\r\nCreate backup of the DB `yb7`. Restore it into DB `yb8`:\r\n```\r\n$ ./bin/ysqlsh -d yb8\r\nyb8=# \\d t4\r\n                     Table \"public.t4\"\r\n Column |       Type       | Collation | Nullable | Default \r\n--------+------------------+-----------+----------+---------\r\n h      | integer          |           | not null | \r\n a      | integer          |           |          | \r\n b      | double precision |           |          | \r\n c      | text             |           |          | \r\nIndexes:\r\n    \"t4_pkey\" PRIMARY KEY, lsm (h HASH)\r\nyb8=# select * from t4;\r\n h | a |  b   |  c  \r\n---+---+------+-----\r\n 1 | 2 | 3.14 | qqq\r\n 4 | 5 | 6.14 | www\r\n(2 rows)\r\n```\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/706757688/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"OlegLoginov","id":31254529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjU0NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31254529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api